# The build context is os/rootfs/packages-src/, the producer family directory,
# and this producer needs three things out of it: the shared copyright file,
# its own control template and its own maintainer script. Everything else --
# the driver, the README, and every sibling producer that lands beside it -- is
# excluded, so an edit there does not invalidate this producer's context.
#
# The payload itself is not here. It arrives through the `overlay` build
# context os/rootfs/packages-src/build-deb.sh resolves from producer.env.
*
!copyright
!system/control/*.control
!system/maintainer/**
